Poker Hand [Dataset], Robert Cattral and Franz Oppacher (2006),
UCI Machine Learning Repository. https://doi.org/10.24432/C5KW38
Source: https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/158/poker+hand
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (included).
Downloaded on 2026-10-18. Both original data files were used, unchanged, as
an offline evaluator validation corpus. The app bundles validation counts,
not the original records. All 1,025,010 labels are checked by the importer.
Royal flush (UCI label 9) is separated from straight flush for validation;
the app groups all straight flushes into its standard nine-category chart.
